  "summary": {
    "text": "SmolLM3 is a 3B-parameter open-weight language model from Hugging Face, released under Apache 2.0 as a base model and an instruct model with switchable extended thinking. It natively supports six languages and handles up to 128k tokens of context, and Hugging Face published its architecture details, data mixtures and training configurations.",
